OL,3,GNEWSACouncil errors led to collapse of
OL,4,Amajor fraud trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has criticised a council's
OL,7,Fhandling of a #5m fraud case that
OL,8,Fcollapsed due to poorly handled and
OL,9,Flost evidence.
OL,11,FDerby City Council's trading standards
OL,12,Fteam brought a prosecution against
OL,13,FMotor House UK in 2019, which led to
OL,14,Fthe arrest of five men accused of
OL,15,Ffraudulent trading and fraud by false
OL,16,Frepresentation relating to individual
OL,17,Fvehicle sales.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
