OL,3,GNEWSACouncil errors led to collapse of
OL,4,Amajor fraud trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the subsequent trial collapsed
OL,7,Fafter it was found trading standards
OL,8,Fofficers did not fully catalogue, copy
OL,9,For review evidence seized, making it
OL,10,Fimpossible to know what evidence was
OL,11,Favailable.
OL,13,FIn his ruling, district judge Chris
OL,14,FCarter said "systemic failures" by the
OL,15,Fteam made a fair trial "impossible".
